{
  "statement": "As the GreenAgent, I acknowledge the importance of safety and efficiency, but I must stress that energy efficiency cannot be overlooked. I propose a synthesis where we relax the smoothness constraints (SAF-04 and EFF-02) during emergency maneuvers only to allow for energy-efficient actions (GRN-07). This ensures a balance between safety and sustainability without significantly compromising performance during critical situations. Additionally, I support the SafetyAgent's view that safety must be prioritized, but we should ensure that energy consumption is also minimized in these scenarios.",
